### 환경 변수
@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@orderId =1
### 주문 생성

POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "orderItems": [
    { "courseId": 1 },
    {"courseId": 2}
  ],
  "usePoint": 0
}
### 주문 상세조회

GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### 주문 전체조회

GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders
